@startuml class
title 房間建立、加入與階段同步 - 類別圖
class Room {
  code : string
  status : Open | Closed
  createdAt : datetime
  lastActivityAt : datetime
  teacherToken : string
  recoveryCode : string
  closedReason : Manual | IdleTimeout
  closedAt : datetime
  phase : Waiting | Answering | Ended
  round : int (每次開始搶答 +1)
}
class PhaseChange <<append-only>> {
  phase : Answering | Ended
  round : int
  by : Teacher
  changedAt : datetime (UTC, 後端產生)
}
class Group {
  name : string
  normalizedName : string
  online : boolean
  joinedAt : datetime
}
class Teacher {
  token : string
}
note right of Room
  recoveryCode 與 code 不同，
  房間代碼不具老師權限。
  lastActivityAt 滿 2 小時無活動
  則自動 Closed (IdleTimeout)。
end note
Teacher "1" -- "0..*" Room : 建立
Room "1" *-- "0..*" PhaseChange : 階段變更紀錄
Room "1" *-- "0..*" Group : 包含\n(組名於房間內唯一)
@enduml
